  "notes": "COMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n・{実|み}がなる (fruit grows, bears fruit)\n・{実|み}を{結|むす}ぶ (to bear fruit, come to fruition)\n・{実|み}を{付|つ}ける (to bear fruit)\n・{実|み}のある{話|はなし} (substantive talk, meaningful discussion)\n・{実|み}のない{話|はなし} (empty talk, meaningless discussion)\n\nRELATED KANJI READINGS:\n・{実|み} - fruit, content\n・{実|じつ} - truth, reality (as in {実|じつ}は)\n・{実|みの}る - to ripen, bear fruit (verb)\n\nNOTE:\nDistinguish from {身|み} (body) and {味|み} (taste) which share the same reading.",
